{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Restrict access to premium content with custom paywall screens.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default the PSReader SDK does "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" restrict access to any content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Paywalls are entirely opt-in: you implement the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PaywallDelegate","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provide view controllers that conform to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PaywallViewController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", and assign"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the delegate to your "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/GlobalConfiguration","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"How It Works","anchor":"How-It-Works","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a user attempts to open an edition, download an edition, or tap a search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"result, the SDK consults a paywall delegate. When the SDK finds a delegate, the flow is:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User taps an edition to open or download it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK calls the relevant ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PaywallDelegate","type":"reference"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your delegate returns a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PaywallViewController","isActive":true},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" to skip the paywall).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK sets the "},{"code":"onDismiss","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" closure on your view controller and presents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it modally. Presentation style is controlled by your view controller —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the SDK does not set one."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK suspends the originating action and waits on ","type":"text"},{"code":"onDismiss","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the user finishes, your view controller dismisses itself and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"then"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"invokes ","type":"text"},{"code":"onDismiss(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to grant access or ","type":"text"},{"code":"onDismiss(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to deny","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it. The SDK resumes the suspended action with that decision.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" a dismissal command — it is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"continuation callback that tells the SDK whether to grant access. Your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view controller owns its own dismissal: call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dismiss(animated:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"yourself, and make sure "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" is invoked exactly once when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paywall flow ends (including when the user dismisses the paywall"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"interactively, e.g. by swiping a sheet down). See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywall-Integration#Dismissing-the-Paywall","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" below."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The delegate methods receive different model objects depending on the edition","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"type. Knowing their properties helps you make informed paywall decisions.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PSEdition"},{"type":"text","text":" represents a replica (PDF) edition."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"PSEPublished","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" represents a feed edition.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Creating a PaywallViewController","anchor":"Creating-a-PaywallViewController","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your paywall screen must conform to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PaywallViewController","type":"reference"},{"text":". The protocol","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"requires a single property — ","type":"text"},{"code":"onDismiss","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — which the SDK sets before the view","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"controller is presented. Invoke it when the user completes or cancels the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"paywall flow, passing ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to grant access or ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to deny it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import PSReader","","class MyPaywallScreen: UIViewController, PSReader.PaywallViewController {","    var onDismiss: ((Bool) -> Void)?","","    \/\/ Build your paywall UI...","","    @objc func userDidSubscribe() {","        dismiss(animated: true) {","            self.onDismiss?(true) \/\/ Grant access","        }","    }","","    @objc func userDidCancel() {","        dismiss(animated: true) {","            self.onDismiss?(false) \/\/ Deny access","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Invoke "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"exactly once","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"after"}]},{"type":"text","text":" dismissal completes."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Dismissing-the-Paywall","text":"Dismissing the Paywall"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your view controller is responsible for its own dismissal — the SDK presents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the paywall modally and leaves presentation style and dismissal entirely up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to you. If you use a presentation style that allows interactive dismissal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g. a sheet that can be swiped down), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" needs to fire on that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path too, not only for dismissals triggered by your own UI. The cleanest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way to cover both is to centralize the callback in "},{"code":"viewDidDisappear(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"code":["class MyPaywallScreen: UIViewController, PSReader.PaywallViewController {","    var onDismiss: ((Bool) -> Void)?","","    private var didGrantAccess = false","","    @objc func userDidSubscribe() {","        didGrantAccess = true","        dismiss(animated: true)","    }","","    @objc func userDidCancel() {","        dismiss(animated: true)","    }","","    \/\/ Catches dismissals triggered by your own UI and any interactive","    \/\/ dismissals (e.g. a sheet swiped down) in one place. Alternatively,","    \/\/ use UIAdaptivePresentationControllerDelegate.presentationControllerDidDismiss","    \/\/ to hook interactive dismissal explicitly and invoke onDismiss from","    \/\/ your own UI handlers instead.","    override func viewDidDisappear(_ animated: Bool) {","        super.viewDidDisappear(animated)","        guard isBeingDismissed else { return }","        onDismiss?(didGrantAccess)","        onDismiss = nil \/\/ Guard against double invocation","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"aside","name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"without"}]},{"type":"text","text":" dismissing the view controller will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leave the paywall on screen even though the SDK has moved on. Conversely,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dismissing the view controller without invoking "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" will leave the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SDK waiting indefinitely."}]}],"style":"warning"},{"text":"Implementing PaywallDelegate","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Implementing-PaywallDelegate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The delegate has five methods — two for opening editions, two for downloading"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them, and one for search results:"}]},{"code":["struct MyPaywallDelegate: PSReader.PaywallDelegate {","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openReplicaEdition edition: PSEdition","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        return MyPaywallScreen()","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openFeedEdition published: PSEPublished","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        return MyPaywallScreen()","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        downloadReplicaEdition edition: PSEdition","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        \/\/ Default implementation delegates to openReplicaEdition.","        return paywallViewControllerForAction(openReplicaEdition: edition)","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        downloadFeedEdition published: PSEPublished","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        \/\/ Default implementation delegates to openFeedEdition.","        return paywallViewControllerForAction(openFeedEdition: published)","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openSearchResult result: SearchResult","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        \/\/ Default implementation returns nil (no paywall).","        return nil","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"aside","name":"Tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The download methods have default implementations that delegate to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponding open methods, and the search result method defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You only need to override them if your paywall logic differs.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"tip"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that separate methods exist for replica and feed editions. See"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Replica-and-Feed-Editions","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for background on the two systems."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Conditional Paywalls","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Conditional-Paywalls"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Return ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from any delegate method to skip the paywall for that edition.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This lets you implement conditional access logic:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct MyPaywallDelegate: PSReader.PaywallDelegate {","","    let userIsSubscribed: Bool","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openFeedEdition published: PSEPublished","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        \/\/ No paywall for subscribers","        if userIsSubscribed { return nil }","","        \/\/ No paywall for supplements","        if published.isSupplement { return nil }","","        return MyPaywallScreen()","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openReplicaEdition edition: PSEdition","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        if userIsSubscribed { return nil }","        return MyPaywallScreen()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Assigning the Delegate","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Assigning-the-Delegate"},{"text":"Global Level","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Global-Level"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the delegate on your "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/GlobalConfiguration","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply it across the entire"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SDK. For most use cases, this is all you need."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var globalConfig = PSReader.GlobalConfiguration(","    apiKey: apiKey,","    accountGUID: accountGUID",")","globalConfig.paywallDelegate = MyPaywallDelegate()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Carousel Level","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Carousel-Level"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set the delegate on a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/CarouselConfiguration","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to override the global delegate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for all sections within a specific carousel:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var carouselConfig = PSReader.CarouselConfiguration(globalConfig: globalConfig)","carouselConfig.paywallDelegate = MyCarouselPaywallDelegate()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Per-Section Level","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Per-Section-Level"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set the delegate on an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ArchiveConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to override the paywall for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single section. This is useful when different publications within the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carousel have different access rules:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var premiumArchiveConfig = PSReader.ArchiveConfiguration(globalConfig: globalConfig)","premiumArchiveConfig.paywallDelegate = PremiumPaywallDelegate()","","let sections: [PSReader.CarouselViewController.SectionItem] = [","    \/\/ This section uses the per-section paywall","    .section(.init(","        name: \"Premium\",","        type: .feedArchive(guid: \"PREMIUM_GUID\", config: premiumArchiveConfig)","    )),","    \/\/ This section falls back to the global or carousel paywall","    .section(.init(","        name: \"Free\",","        type: .feedArchive(guid: \"FREE_GUID\")","    ))","]"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Search Result Paywalls","anchor":"Search-Result-Paywalls","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openSearchResult"},{"text":" method is called when a user taps a search result. By","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default it returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", meaning search results open without a paywall.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Override it to restrict access:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["func paywallViewControllerForAction(","    openSearchResult result: SearchResult",") -> PaywallViewController? {","    guard !subscriptionManager.isSubscribed else { return nil }","    return SubscriptionPaywall()","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SearchResult","isActive":true},{"text":" provides ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"editionId"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"publicationId"},{"text":", and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"applicationId"},{"text":" properties that you can use to make per-publication or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"per-edition access decisions.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"See ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Search","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" for the full search integration guide.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Open vs Download Paywalls","anchor":"Open-vs-Download-Paywalls","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In most cases the same paywall applies to both actions. However, some","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"publishers may want to allow free streaming while requiring a subscription to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"download.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The download delegate methods have default implementations that call through to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the corresponding open methods. Override them to differentiate:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct StreamingPaywallDelegate: PSReader.PaywallDelegate {","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openReplicaEdition edition: PSEdition","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        \/\/ Free to open and read (streaming)","        return nil","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openFeedEdition published: PSEPublished","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        return nil","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        downloadReplicaEdition edition: PSEdition","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        \/\/ Require subscription for offline downloads","        return MyPaywallScreen()","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        downloadFeedEdition published: PSEPublished","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        return MyPaywallScreen()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"text":"Troubleshooting","anchor":"Troubleshooting","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paywall stays on screen and the edition never opens"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You dismissed the paywall but never invoked "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" (or never invoked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either). The SDK is suspended waiting on the callback — without it, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"originating action stays parked indefinitely. Make sure "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" fires"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on every dismissal path, including interactive ones. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"viewDidDisappear"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pattern shown in "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Paywall-Integration#Dismissing-the-Paywall","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" handles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"all paths in one place.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paywall reappears after the user closes the edition"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You invoked ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss(true)"},{"text":" but didn’t call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dismiss(animated:)"},{"text":". The SDK","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"uses ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"text":" purely as the access-decision signal — it does not control","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presentation. The paywall stays in the view hierarchy underneath the edition","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader and becomes visible again when the edition is closed. Dismiss your","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view controller in addition to invoking ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Paywall and edition appear together, or the transition looks broken","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You’re invoking ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss(true)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the dismissal animation finishes.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The SDK resumes the originating action the moment the closure fires, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next view controller (e.g. the edition reader) tries to present while your","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"paywall is still on screen. Invoke ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDismiss"},{"type":"text","text":" from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dismiss(animated:completion:)"},{"type":"text","text":" completion handler or from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"viewDidDisappear(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Wrong paywall appears for a section","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Check the delegate cascade. A per-section delegate on "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/ArchiveConfiguration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes priority over the carousel and global delegates. Verify which level your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delegate is assigned to and whether a more specific override exists."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Download always shows a paywall even though open is free","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default download methods delegate to the open methods. If your open method"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" but downloads still show a paywall, you may have a separate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delegate assigned at a different cascade level that overrides the download"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"methods. Check all three levels."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Complete-Example","type":"heading","text":"Complete Example","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An end-to-end integration tying everything together:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import PSReader","","\/\/ 1. Create a paywall view controller","class SubscriptionPaywall: UIViewController, PSReader.PaywallViewController {","    var onDismiss: ((Bool) -> Void)?","","    private var didGrantAccess = false","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        \/\/ Set up your subscription UI...","    }","","    @objc func subscribe() {","        \/\/ Handle subscription logic, then grant access.","        didGrantAccess = true","        dismiss(animated: true)","    }","","    @objc func cancel() {","        dismiss(animated: true)","    }","","    \/\/ Catches dismissals triggered by your own UI and any interactive","    \/\/ dismissals (e.g. a sheet swiped down) in one place. Alternatively, use","    \/\/ UIAdaptivePresentationControllerDelegate.presentationControllerDidDismiss.","    override func viewDidDisappear(_ animated: Bool) {","        super.viewDidDisappear(animated)","        guard isBeingDismissed else { return }","        onDismiss?(didGrantAccess)","        onDismiss = nil","    }","}","","\/\/ 2. Implement the delegate","struct AppPaywallDelegate: PSReader.PaywallDelegate {","","    let subscriptionManager: SubscriptionManager","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openReplicaEdition edition: PSEdition","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        guard !subscriptionManager.isSubscribed else { return nil }","        return SubscriptionPaywall()","    }","","    func paywallViewControllerForAction(","        openFeedEdition published: PSEPublished","    ) -> PaywallViewController? {","        guard !subscriptionManager.isSubscribed else { return nil }","        if published.isSupplement { return nil }","        return SubscriptionPaywall()","    }","}","","\/\/ 3. Assign to the global configuration","var globalConfig = PSRea